1
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:03,417
I’m right here with you.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,375
It’s our English class!

3
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:09,708
Welcome, families! Come on in.

4
00:00:12,917 --> 00:00:15,750
Children up front. Grown-ups behind.

5
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:18,750
Sit with us, Yoonsu!

6
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:21,625
I’ll watch from here.

7
00:00:24,792 --> 00:00:26,375
Look at this picture.

8
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:29,417
What do you see?

9
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,750
It’s a sun!

10
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:34,958
Yes! A bright yellow sun.

11
00:00:36,792 --> 00:00:38,500
I know that word.

12
00:00:39,583 --> 00:00:41,458
But I feel shy.

13
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:45,917
That’s okay. I feel shy sometimes, too.

14
00:00:48,792 --> 00:00:50,917
Let’s take one slow breath.

15
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,167
You can start with one sentence.

16
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,167
Can I try?

17
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:59,958
Yes. You can ask just like that.

18
00:01:01,708 --> 00:01:03,208
Can I try?

19
00:01:03,375 --> 00:01:04,917
Yoonsu, your turn.

20
00:01:05,083 --> 00:01:06,583
Can I try?

21
00:01:10,917 --> 00:01:13,583
You did it. I heard you.

22
00:01:14,792 --> 00:01:16,875
Here comes the next picture.

23
00:01:17,792 --> 00:01:19,542
What shape is this?

24
00:01:20,458 --> 00:01:22,333
I know this one.

25
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:25,000
Ready? Raise your hand.

26
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:29,667
Can I try?

27
00:01:30,458 --> 00:01:32,542
Yes, Yoonsu. Take your time.

28
00:01:33,417 --> 00:01:34,667
It’s a star.

29
00:01:35,458 --> 00:01:37,958
That’s right! Thank you for sharing.

30
00:01:39,708 --> 00:01:41,208
It’s a star.

31
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:43,042
Yoonsu, your turn.

32
00:01:43,208 --> 00:01:44,708
It’s a star.

33
00:01:49,042 --> 00:01:52,042
You raised your hand and tried. Well done!

34
00:01:53,792 --> 00:01:55,958
I heard you, Yoonsu!

35
00:01:56,125 --> 00:01:59,833
You took your time. I loved hearing you.

36
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,333
I want to try again.

37
00:02:03,792 --> 00:02:06,208
What fruit do you like?

38
00:02:07,042 --> 00:02:08,917
I like bananas.

39
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:11,042
I like apples.

40
00:02:11,875 --> 00:02:14,000
Thank you, both of you!

41
00:02:15,708 --> 00:02:17,125
I like apples.

42
00:02:17,458 --> 00:02:19,000
Yoonsu, your turn.

43
00:02:19,375 --> 00:02:20,792
I like apples.

44
00:02:25,417 --> 00:02:26,750
Nice and clear!

45
00:02:28,833 --> 00:02:32,708
Who would like to come up and say hello?

46
00:02:32,875 --> 00:02:34,583
I can do it.

47
00:02:34,750 --> 00:02:36,875
Whenever you’re ready, Yoonsu.

48
00:02:37,042 --> 00:02:39,167
Hello! My name’s Yoonsu.

49
00:02:39,333 --> 00:02:41,417
I like apples. Thank you!

50
00:02:42,708 --> 00:02:44,458
My name’s Yoonsu.

51
00:02:44,708 --> 00:02:46,250
Yoonsu, your turn.

52
00:02:46,417 --> 00:02:48,167
My name’s Yoonsu.

53
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,042
That was your own brave voice.

54
00:02:56,792 --> 00:02:59,375
Let’s give Yoonsu a little clap.

55
00:03:01,167 --> 00:03:03,125
Great job, Yoonsu!

56
00:03:03,292 --> 00:03:05,708
I’m proud of you for trying.

57
00:03:05,875 --> 00:03:10,125
You took a breath, raised your hand, and spoke.

58
00:03:11,792 --> 00:03:13,958
I was shy. Then I tried.

59
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,958
I’ll be there, cheering for you.

60
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:20,667
One breath. One hand. One sentence.
